is_visible = {
  OR = {
    character = FROM
    society_member_of = secret_religious_society_catholic
    AND = {
      is_close_relative = FROM
      trait = secretly_catholic
    }
  }
}

The trait will only be visible on other characters if the player also has it. Handy for things like secret societies, cults, and secret bears. This is a shortcut for: is_visible = { 
	OR = {
		character = FROM
		has_trait = <trait>
	}
}
